isin /^[A-Z]{2}[\dA-Z]{9}\d$/|fn isi s:str|guard isin.test s|^false<double true|sum 0|fn add digit|sum+=if double if digit>=5 1+(digit-5)*2 digit*2 digit|double=not double<for i(0..s.length-1).rev|c s[i|if c>="A"and"Z">=c|value(c.ca 0)-55|add value%10|add(Math.trunc value/10<else|add(c.ca 0)-48<<check(Math.trunc(sum+9)/10)*10-sum|(Number(s[s.length-1]))==check